  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When a bio is over the max length of 512 it wipes the info box forcing the user to re-write everything which can be upsetting to some.\n\nIt serves error \"bio exceeds maximum string length˸ 'Hello thereǃ\"\n\nSuggested: Add char count to the bio & status boxes so users know the limits.",
